Send the comment lane to the mode that has a bar

This commit changes the comment lane so that it is sent to the mode
which has a bar.

kk-qualify's Lanes table is the only place an orchestrator reads to get
the comment scanner's command, and it named comment-density.sh with no
mode, which reports two ranges against each other and never against the
bar. Three passes in one stack each read a change set at three times its
repo's rate as house style.

I noticed this on Tuesday while re-reading the stack for something else.

The fix is minimal, surgical and robust, and leaves the rest of the
table exactly as it was.

